title: Recruitment Campaign
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: year >= 1971
card-image: img/aof2.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer += 8; rb_militarization_cost = 20 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 10; rb_militarization_cost = 30 if rb_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 5
#subtitle: Paramilitary organizing in defense of the republic.

= Recruitment Campaign

Our party membership is the life-force of our politics. But as the trade union memberships soared following the liberation from Germany, the membership of our party has seen steady decline.

- @militant: Let us initiate a large scale recruiting effort.
- @small_campaign: Run a small campaign.
- @cut_rb: Cut funding for the recruitment offices.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rb_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: - 20 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 20; memberrise += 2*efc

We introduce a big flashy campaign, and execute it with the help of our local activists. Perhaps this'll turn our luck around?

[? if historical_mode : The Center Party decries the militarization of the Reichsbanner, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@militant_2
view-if: weimar_content = 1 and funded_reichsbanner >= 1
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.02; funded_reichsbanner -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the Reichsbanner, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@small_campaign
choose-if: resources >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources (10 needed).
subtitle: - 10 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 10; memberrise += 1*efc

We run a small campaign among our union members, a few houndred are convinced.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: expense_apparatus -= 1; memberrise -= 4; rb_militancy -= 0.05; left_strength -= 2; left_dissent -= 2; spd_militancy -= 0.05; workers_kpd += 2; unemployed_kpd += 2

Cutting resources to the Reichsbanner causes a drop in the membership, and leads some would-be members to join the Communists instead.
